00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:36.150
or to check out our
website on snyk.io.

00:14:36.150 --> 00:14:41.250
You can try the tools that
I showed you for free.

00:14:41.250 --> 00:14:43.890
And yeah, thank you
all for being so great.

